      "author": "Asha Moreno <asha.moreno@harborviewexpo.org>",
      "subject": "Door-camera note: West Gate",
      "shortSummary": "Theo reports an unbadged visitor requesting entry at West Gate.",
      "date": "0001-01-01T00:00:00",
      "body": "Theo Kwan sent this observation from physical security for review.\n\nDoor-camera note (T. Kwan):\nA person wearing a vendor shirt carried boxes toward West Gate and asked a volunteer to hold the staff door. The person had no visible badge and claimed an urgent delivery for the LanternPass desk. The camera note does not establish whether entry occurred.\n\nAsha",
      "attachements": []
    },
